      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "94356BBC86F9FF01001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的目標是成為最強的鐵殼蛹行家，\n目前正在修行！請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳當我的對手吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
