    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是很強的訓練家。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我想我的鐵殼蛹們\n也獲得了很不錯的經驗。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F5F885F3776848A137DF45BB6300200100001BE01000A621160F36211768494356BBC86F95011000A4E5F73725F974E865F884E0D932F76847D939A573002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊！\n獲得經驗值的話可不行啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
