      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F6C9295DC4FC2FF01000A87F25BF653EF5922903253165F975FEB3002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我只需要珍惜能和鐵殼蛹相處的\n短暫時光就可以了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA9700898173CD60DC80FD548C94356BBC86F976F886557684000A77ED66AB664251495C3153EF4EE54E863002001000020114012B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是從同行隊伍進化喔",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F5F9E540C884C968A4F0D9032531655940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？一般來說如果不從同行隊伍\n選擇進化，寶可夢就不會進化嗎？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我的鐵殼蛹是萬中選一？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕī",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
